; ── CaptiveMainsCord: an appliance's own mains cord ─────────────────────────────
;
; The rope starts at the appliance's PowerCordExit (handed over by CaptiveMainsCord.
; attach) and ends in this wall plug: PowerCord's WallPlug, its prongs whatever the
; player's region sells an appliance with (set_region swaps the connector, the mesh
; and the box). The root never moves: it hangs off the current scene, not the
; appliance, as the captive video lead does.
[node name="CaptiveMainsCord" type="Node3D"]
script = ExtResource("1_cord")

